# W5s, a (k5): hosts a Private instance in stag0101; the moderator c joins it by his own choice of the row.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@80
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log a hosts
wander -150 -60 20 until present=2,sealed>=300 fail frames>=9000
log the moderator joined
wander -150 -60 20 until frames>=1200
disk 8 until stage=stagml11,control
